## Project Objectives

- Understand Docker container networking.
- Create attacker and target containers.
- Demonstrate connectivity in a flat network.
- Demonstrate controlled SSH lateral movement.
- Segment attacker and target into separate networks.
- Introduce pfSense as a security layer.
- Understand routing versus firewalling.
- Configure a TCP/22 firewall policy.
- Apply CPU and memory limits.
- Troubleshoot connectivity using evidence.
- Prepare the environment for future SOC monitoring.
